<title>LITHUANIA: TELECOM H1 PROFIT 50.6 MLN LITAS.</title>
<headline>TELECOM H1 PROFIT 50.6 MLN LITAS.</headline>
<dateline>VILNIUS 1997-07-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>First half 1997.</p>
<p>				    (million litas unless stated)</p>
<p> Net profit			   50.57	vs  40.39</p>
<p> Turnover			    304.86	vs 255.83</p>
<p> Operating expenses		113.80	vs  72.71</p>
<p> Operating profit		   69.86	vs  46.66</p>
<p> Financial, investment activity  2.13	vs  497,411 litas</p>
<p> Extraordinary profit		2.06	vs  1.34</p>
<p> Extraordinary loss		  2.69	vs  135,556 litas</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit		     70.37	vs  47.85</p>
<p>NOTE -- Lithuanian Telecom is currently state-owned but is</p>
<p>one of the key state companies on the government's privatisation</p>
<p>list.</p>
<p>-- Vilnius newsroom +370 2 223 518</p>
</text>
